    "status": "accepted_selected_clips",
    "notes": "Reviewed on H3 video. Idle v1, ranged v1, hit v1 and death v1 are clean; in the hit the canister swings out on its cable and settles. Attack v1 and v2 smeared the canister and swung it behind her, so attack v3 is used: it jumps from the wind-up (38) to the full lash (52) past its smear frames, and reels the canister straight back to her side. Defend v1 and v2 showed an object on the ground, copied from a sliver of the next pose in the painted defend_1; defend v3 is guided by defend_2 only and is clean. Cast v1 and v2 strobed; cast v3 is steady. The walk keeps the published clip."
